# Allow-list, because the excludes vastly outnumber the includes: the repo is
# 278M but the two images between them need only `dist/` and the two Gleam
# source trees. Sending the rest costs a multi-second upload on every build.
*

!fsrs
!server
!dist
!deploy

# Build output inside the allowed trees. `fsrs/build` and `server/build` are
# stale host artifacts; the image compiles its own.
fsrs/build
server/build

# Real secrets, untracked and gitignored. Must never reach an image layer.
server/.env

**/.git
